<<<
emergence, emergency. The two are now completely differentiated, -ce meaning emerging or coming into notice, & -cy meaning a juncture that has arisen, esp. one that calls for prompt measures, & also (more recently) the presence of such a juncture (in case of -cy). See -CE, -CY.
===
**emergence, emergency.** The two are now completely differentiated, *-ce* meaning emerging or coming into notice, & *-cy* meaning a juncture that has arisen, esp. one that calls for prompt measures, & also (more recently) the presence of such a juncture *(in case of -cy)*. See ^^-CE^^, ^^-CY^^.
>>>

